Local integration changes include GSP cached instruction fetch and pixel-operation timing,
TG68K barrel-count timing, MiSTer scaler divider pipelining, and disabling the
IKA32010 simulation disassembler for synthesis. The vendored files contain the
actual release sources, including local dependency changes.

